 of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","block":357,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001174922-26-000055","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001174922","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1174922/000117492226000055/wynn-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6368549b88f4d2a807e04d336926bd60ba8b5ce2ebe912eb621f4ce0d50a2480.bin","sha256":"6368549b88f4d2a807e04d336926bd60ba8b5ce2ebe912eb621f4ce0d50a2480"}},{"id":"b1231321776f17e8fb2752127c1c08629f6d961039abd3211e1fe501dcba8267","quote":"•Rolling chips are non-negotiable identifiable chips that are used to track turnover for purposes of calculating incentives within our Macau Operations' VIP program.","context":"•Table drop for Encore Boston Harbor is the amount of cash and gross markers issued that are deposited in a gaming table's drop box.","section":"Item 2. Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","block":358,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001174922-26-000055","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-06","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001174922","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1174922/000117492226000055/wynn-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6368549b88f4d2a807e04d336926bd60ba8b5ce2ebe912eb621f4ce0d50a2480.bin","sha256":"6368549b88f4d2a807e04d336926bd60ba8b5ce2ebe912eb621f4ce0d50a2480"}},{"id":"8abd760e43073d9dbc0d735d2716524a9d72840e0f03f30deb94cb0e8da4af19","quote":"•Turnover is the sum of all losing rolling chip wagers within our Macau Operations' VIP program.","context":"•Rolling chips are non-negotiable identifiable chips that are used to track turnover for purposes of calculating incentives within our Macau Operations' VIP program.","section":"Item 2. Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results 